<title>CANADA: Loewen Group shareholder suit dismissed.</title>
<headline>Loewen Group shareholder suit dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loewen Group Inc said a California Court dismissed a shareholder derivative lawsuit against the company on the grounds it did not have jurisdiction to hear the suit.</p>
<p>The Los Angeles County Superior Court said it did not have jurisdiction to hear the suit because Loewen is based in Vancouver, British Columbia.</p>
<p>The company offered no further details and was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
